### Verify 1 — discovery endpoints & issuer sanity (VS Code REST Client)
### Run after Step 1. Confirms IAS + Entra endpoints resolve and issuers are correct.
### Fill in the two placeholders below (no secrets needed for this file).

@iasHost     = <ias-host>            # e.g. xxxxxxxxx.accounts.ondemand.com
@entraTenant = <entra-tenant-id>

### 1. IAS discovery — expect issuer = https://<ias-host>
GET https://{{iasHost}}/.well-known/openid-configuration
Accept: application/json

### 2. IAS JWKS — expect a "keys" array (gateway uses these to validate tokens)
GET https://{{iasHost}}/oauth2/certs
Accept: application/json

### 3. Entra discovery — expect issuer = https://login.microsoftonline.com/<tenant>/v2.0
GET https://login.microsoftonline.com/{{entraTenant}}/v2.0/.well-known/openid-configuration
Accept: application/json
